## Router Configuration Instructions

1. Log in to your router gateway via browser (`192.168.1.1` or `192.168.0.1`).
2. Navigate to **WAN / Internet / DHCP Settings**.
3. Switch DNS from **Dynamic / ISP Default** to **Static / Manual**.
4. Paste the **Primary** and **Secondary** IP addresses for your desired filter tier.
5. **(Optional)** If your router supports **Encrypted DNS (DoT / DoH)**, select DoT/DoH mode and enter the corresponding **Hostname** or **Endpoint URL**.
6. Save and reboot your router.

